  "why": "Demand noise multiplies revenue, so it is tested on revenue. Dividing by seat miles takes out capacity, which the simulator plans and the history does not hold fixed. Total revenue per seat mile is used, not passenger revenue, because passenger revenue was reclassified in 2018.",
