  "statement": "Demand noise is an assumed 3% a month. Checked against United's unit revenue, 25 of 33 outcomes in 2022-2026 (76%) fell inside the simulator's 80% range. Fuel noise comes from the 65 trading days before the cutoff (13 April 2026 to 16 July 2026), an unusually volatile stretch: more volatile than 92% of such windows since 2013. It sets most of the range's width: with demand noise switched off, 94% of the width of 2026Q4 operating income remains. Source: app/static/data/range_check.json."
